tasks.prompt:
The job card that `pitroom hook-card` prints after a `pitroom run` shows a subject: the text after the first ' · ' in the card's systemMessage. Today it is the whole task text, which is often long. Make it short:
- at most 48 characters, cut at a word boundary, ending with the character '…' when it was cut;
- backticks and markdown heading marks ('#') are removed;
- when the task is a plan brief that starts like 'You are implementing Task 3 of the plan docs/pitroom/plans/2026-09-30-widgets.md (in your copy).', the subject must be 'Task 3 · 2026-09-30-widgets' (the task number, then the plan file name without its directory and '.md').
